BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wheel of Life Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260415T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260415T213000
UID:4b32c875d44ce3133e521363@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be alive? Why do we suffer and what can w
 e do about it? In this six-week course\, Suryagupta\, Chair of the London 
 Buddhist Centre\, will harness her love of stories\, myths\, and symbols t
 o share the powerful image of the Tibetan Wheel of Life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/the-wheel-of-life-apr-20
 26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mind in Harmony
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260505T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260505T213000
UID:009790746a5b166c801722bb@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Long before modern psychology\, the Buddhist tradition develop
 ed a training manual to help us understand and transform our own minds. Th
 is six-week course brings that manual to life\, illuminating the processes
  through which we experience the world.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mind-in-harmony-may-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Buddhism & Deep Ecology Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260517T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260517T170000
UID:7d6eca31d936e01abac01c3c@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join Sanghasiha\, Guhyasakhi\, Kavyamani and friends for a day
  exploring our relationship with the more-than-human world through our Dha
 rma practice. There will be ritual and meditation as well as an introducti
 on to the work of the late American Buddhist teacher\, environmentalist an
 d activist Joanna Macy. Bring vegan lunch to share.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/buddhism-deep-ecology-da
 y-2026-05-17
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Before I Die
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260517T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260517T170000
UID:5dd09db39ae2a3ba7946f3dc@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:When we turn towards the reality of death\, we can discover a 
 deeper response to life: ours and others. Spend a day exploring your feeli
 ngs and beliefs about death and see what opens up for you.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/before-i-die-2026-05-17
END:VEVENT
